## Discovery budget

- **Kanban + Feature Areas** → `docs/lessons-index.yaml` area block + [agent-triage/reference.md](../skills/agent-triage/reference.md) § Lessons by area before broad `.devtool/features/done/` grep ([kanban-prior-lessons-gate.mdc](kanban-prior-lessons-gate.mdc))
- **Top-N forward-feedback questions** → `docs/forward-feedback-index.yaml` + `resolve_forward_feedback.py --category … --top N` — not `lessons-index.yaml`; Signature: `forward-feedback-index`
- **Kanban Tests → Files from Product Paths** → `python3 scripts/resolve_card_tests.py --from-card CARD.md --files-only` before Review — not hand-picked pytest; Signature: `precommit-pytest-scope-mismatch`
- **Forward-feedback depth metrics** → `resolve_forward_feedback.py --report` or `check_governance_parity.py --forward-feedback-stale` — Signature: `forward-feedback-stale-metrics`
- **Failure signals** (hook, pytest, UI wiring, handoff) → [agent-triage/SKILL.md](../skills/agent-triage/SKILL.md) §1b grep before broad reads
- **Governance edits** → [agent-triage/reference.md](../skills/agent-triage/reference.md) § Consistency matrix
- **Docs vs governance layout** (DocsGovernanceSplit) → [kanban-markdown/reference.md](../skills/kanban-markdown/reference.md) § Docs governance layout; contributor handbook [docs/governance/](../../docs/governance/) — not `development.md` § prose; residual § verify: `check_governance_parity.py --docs-governance-split` (Signature: `docs-governance-split`)
- **Governance audit card** → [kanban-markdown/SKILL.md](../skills/kanban-markdown/SKILL.md) § Periodic AGENTS.md governance audit (reference § Classify)
- **Classify signals** — canonical [agent-triage/reference.md](../skills/agent-triage/reference.md) § Classify; AGENTS § Classify quickly ≤5-row summary only; new signal → reference + bump `REFERENCE_CLASSIFY_FINGERPRINT` — Signature: `governance-compact-classify-ssot`
- **Grep** before opening `ui/main_window.py` or other large files
- After **3** full file reads → prefer grep or semantic search
- **No card or review-only prompt** → Ask-only — do not edit (Signature: `kanban-prompt-ask-vs-agent`)

