2. **`### Self-evaluation`** — compact one-line fields; **Context load** + **AGENTS.md** freshness;
   `Skills updated:` / `Rules updated:` on implementation turns. Signature:
   `governance-compact-self-eval-handoff`. See [agent-self-evaluation.mdc](agent-self-evaluation.mdc).

